    <div class="project-story-copy">
      <p class="page-kicker">Connected products · Daikin</p>
      <h3>Helping an internal team move faster.</h3>
      <p>Daikin needed to bring a remote-control app to market while working across its own product and technical teams. At Upstack Studio, we worked alongside them to develop the mobile experience for their connected air conditioners.</p>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>The business constraint</dt><dd>Speed mattered, but the product still had to be clear, dependable and maintainable by the teams involved.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>What I took forward</dt><dd>Good external partners do more than deliver their part. They make it easier for the internal team to move with confidence.</dd></div>
      </dl>
